{"unit_id":"tag:0DEP:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）。若 <MATH_0002> 有足够多的点（points），则 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex）的拉回（pullback），其中原复形由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成，是 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex），由 <MATH_0004>-模（modules）组成。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"拉回对应的态射"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"位点的足够多的点"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"拉回保持的性质"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"拉回前后复形"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"复形拉回"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"两侧系数模"}],"notes":[]}
