{"unit_id":"tag:0FPH:proof","translation":"我们将使用各项（terms）平坦（flat）的 K-平坦（K-flat）分解（resolutions）的存在（引理 <REF_0001>），导出拉回（derived pullback）由这样的复形（complexes）计算这一事实（引理 <REF_0002>），以及拉回（pullbacks）保持这些性质这一事实（引理 <REF_0003>）。若选取这样的分解（resolutions）<MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002>，则可见\n<MATH_0003>\n可交换（commutes）。不过，由 <MATH_0004> 和 <MATH_0005> 的选取以及引理 <REF_0004>，此时图式（diagram）的左侧就是图式（diagram）的左侧。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"derived pullback","target_term":"导出拉回"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项","context":"分解各项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"各项性质"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"分解性质"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解","context":"选取的分解"},{"source_term":"derived pullback","target_term":"导出拉回","context":"所计算的函子"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"计算用复形"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回","context":"拉回保持分解性质"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换","context":"图式交换性"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式","context":"比较图式"}],"notes":["原文结句重复 left hand side of the diagram；忠实保留两次左侧，不将其中一处改为右侧。"]}
