{"unit_id":"tag:07A5:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。范畴（category）<MATH_0002> 是 Grothendieck 阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）：它具有所有余极限（colimits），滤过余极限（filtered colimits）正合（exact），并具有生成对象（generator），即\n<MATH_0003>\n见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》第 <REF_0001> 节以及引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003>。由《内射对象（Injectives）》定理 <REF_0004>，对每个复形（complex）<MATH_0004>（由 <MATH_0005>-模（modules）组成），存在单射的（injective）拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）<MATH_0006>，到一个 K-内射（injective）复形（complex），由 <MATH_0007>-模（modules）组成；而且此嵌入（embedding）可选为关于 <MATH_0008> 函子性的（functorial）。由《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0005> 得出：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 任意正合（exact）函子（functor）<MATH_0009>，映入三角的（trianguated）范畴（category）<MATH_0010>，都有右导出函子（derived functor）<MATH_0011>，\n<STRUCT_0004> 对任意加性的（additive）函子（functor）\n<MATH_0012>\n映入阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）<MATH_0013>，考虑正合（exact）函子（functor）<MATH_0014>，由 <MATH_0015> 诱导，从而得到右导出函子（derived functor）<MATH_0016>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n由构造，有 <MATH_0017>，其中 <MATH_0018> 如上。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n以下是上述构造的一些例子：\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<STRUCT_0009> 函子（functor）<MATH_0019> 给出\n<MATH_0020>\n我们将使用记号（notation）<MATH_0021> 表示上同调（cohomology）。\n<STRUCT_0010> 对对象（object）<MATH_0022>（属于 <MATH_0023>），考虑函子（functor）<MATH_0024>。这给出\n<MATH_0025>\n我们将使用记号（notation）<MATH_0026> 表示上同调（cohomology）。\n<STRUCT_0011> 对赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）\n<MATH_0027>\n考虑函子（functor）\n<MATH_0028>\n它给出全直像（direct image）\n<MATH_0029>\n作用在无界（unbounded）导出范畴（derived categories）上。\n<STRUCT_0012>\n\n","allowed_english":["Grothendieck","K"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"filtered colimits","target_term":"滤过余极限"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"generator","target_term":"生成对象"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"Injectives","target_term":"内射对象"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"embedding","target_term":"嵌入"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性的"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"trianguated","target_term":"三角的"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"右导出函子"},{"source_term":"additive","target_term":"加性的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"右导出函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"direct image","target_term":"全直像"},{"source_term":"unbounded","target_term":"无界"},{"source_term":"derived categories","target_term":"导出范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"模范畴及目标范畴"},{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴","context":"模范畴及目标范畴"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限","context":"Grothendieck 范畴性质"},{"source_term":"filtered colimits","target_term":"滤过余极限","context":"模范畴滤过余极